    {
      "name": "naver_list_products",
      "description": "List products in the seller's Naver Smart Store with paging and optional filters (status, name, product numbers). 스마트스토어 상품 목록을 조회합니다. Use first to find channelProductNo/originProductNo before updating stock. Needs nothing but optional filters.",
